<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Tabletop Harvest and the person behind it.">
  <h1>About Tabletop Harvest</h1>
  <p>Tabletop Harvest is a guide for normal people who want to grow real food indoors — without a backyard, a greenhouse, or a degree in botany.</p>
  <p>We cover hydroponics, LED grow lights, indoor soil gardening, microgreens, and product reviews. Everything here is tested by us, written in plain English, and designed to help you grow your first harvest as fast as possible.</p>
  <p>We earn revenue through display ads and affiliate commissions, but we only recommend products we've actually used and believe in.</p>
  <p>Got a question or a product you want us to review? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
